00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:00.873
Yes. So it's called Baby
Dynamics and basically,

00:02:00.873 --> 00:02:02.070
(Kelly laughing)

00:02:02.070 --> 00:02:06.692
it was like sort of early, you
know, hand eye coordination.

00:02:06.692 --> 00:02:08.401
